      <h3>Holding Deposit Policy</h3>
      <p>
        To secure a property, prospective tenants are required to pay a holding deposit equivalent to one week's rent.
        This amount will be credited towards the first month's rent upon successful completion of referencing and signing
        of the tenancy agreement.
      </p>
      <p>
        The holding deposit is non-refundable in the following circumstances:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>The applicant provides false or misleading information on the application form</li>
        <li>The applicant fails a Right to Rent check</li>
        <li>The applicant withdraws from the proposed tenancy without reasonable cause</li>
        <li>The applicant fails to take reasonable steps to enter into the tenancy agreement within the agreed deadline</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-muted"><small>Fees correct as of January 2024. All fees subject to VAT at the prevailing rate.</small></p>

